{"type":"text","timestamp":1778976222434,"sessionID":"ses_1ccc2adf2ffeatol4v4Z7P0oHR","part":{"id":"prt_e333edefb001nlRz8A2UyWHMmZ","messageID":"msg_e333ed60f001wzm6ix4nSf26LS","sessionID":"ses_1ccc2adf2ffeatol4v4Z7P0oHR","type":"text","text":"This project guidance asks ontology edits to link back to the tracker item. Since the Lugaro term did not already reference issue `#3550`, I’m adding a single `IAO_0000233` annotation to the Lugaro stanza along with the parent change.","time":{"start":1778976218875,"end":1778976222431}}}
