{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778976278213,"sessionID":"ses_1ccc2adf2ffeatol4v4Z7P0oHR","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_dDTaVGd2HFBh6N9tmg6XmEGX","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Updated Lugaro cell (CL:0011006) so its named superclass is Purkinje layer interneuron (CL:4072102), with a tracker annotation back to this issue. Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+This updates the classification of Lugaro cell (CL:0011006) to align with issue #3550.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+- Replaced the named superclass of Lugaro cell from interneuron (CL:0000099) to Purkinje layer interneuron (CL:4072102).\n+- Added an IAO:0000233 tracker annotation linking CL:0011006 to https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3550.\n+- Left the existing location and neurotransmitter axioms unchanged.\n+\n+Rationale:\n+- The issue requested moving the species-neutral Lugaro cell classification under Purkinje layer interneuron, in line with WMB/literature usage.\n+- Purkinje layer interneuron is defined as an interneuron residing in the Purkinje cell layer of the cerebellar cortex, matching the requested parent classification.\n+\n+Checks completed:\n+- Confirmed existing labels and axioms for CL:0011006, CL:4023057, and CL:4072102 in src/ontology/cl-edit.owl.\n+- Confirmed the Lugaro cell stanza now has SubClassOf(obo:CL_0011006 obo:CL_4072102).\n+- Ran `robot convert --input src/ontology/cl-edit.owl --output /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-issue-3550.owl` successfully.\n+\n+Signed-off-by: GitHub Copilot\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,1 @@\n+Updated Lugaro cell (CL:0011006) so its named superclass is Purkinje layer interneuron (CL:4072102), with a tracker annotation back to this issue. Changes committed in PR #<NN>.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@\n+This updates the classification of Lugaro cell (CL:0011006) to align with issue #3550.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+- Replaced the named superclass of Lugaro cell from interneuron (CL:0000099) to Purkinje layer interneuron (CL:4072102).\n+- Added an IAO:0000233 tracker annotation linking CL:0011006 to https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3550.\n+- Left the existing location and neurotransmitter axioms unchanged.\n+\n+Rationale:\n+- The issue requested moving the species-neutral Lugaro cell classification under Purkinje layer interneuron, in line with WMB/literature usage.\n+- Purkinje layer interneuron is defined as an interneuron residing in the Purkinje cell layer of the cerebellar cortex, matching the requested parent classification.\n+\n+Checks completed:\n+- Confirmed existing labels and axioms for CL:0011006, CL:4023057, and CL:4072102 in src/ontology/cl-edit.owl.\n+- Confirmed the Lugaro cell stanza now has SubClassOf(obo:CL_0011006 obo:CL_4072102).\n+- Ran `robot convert --input src/ontology/cl-edit.owl --output /tmp/opencode/cl-edit-issue-3550.owl` successfully.\n+\n+Signed-off-by: GitHub Copilot\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/